 "strings": {
  "Just talking about this is\npractically entrapment!": "",
  "Not to be rude... but I asked Saori-san,\nnot you. Why do you care so much anyway?": "",
  "Not to be rude... but why are you getting so worked up?\nI asked Saori-san, not you.": "",
  "Because I care about her!": "",
  "Hoo-boy.": "",
  "You... what?": "",
  "Er, no, I... I-I mean I have...\nI have a lot of respect for her, as a coworker.": "",
  "Er, no, I just... I have a lot of respect\nfor her, as a coworker.": "",
  "Well, that's enough of that. Yagami.\nYou're sure there'll be no risk to Saori-kun?": "",
  "All right, enough of that... Now, Yagami.\nYou're sure there'll be no risk to Saori-kun?": "",
  "Absolutely. I have a plan.": "",
  "Absolutely. It'll be fine.\nI have a plan.": "",
  "Which is what, exactly?": "",
  "I'll tell you once we get there.\nFirst I need to know if you're in.": "",
  "I'll tell you once we get there. Before that, though,\nI need to know if you're in.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If I can help him\nexpose the truth... Then...)</color>": "",
  "It's what the investigation calls for.": "",
  "I'll do what I must.": "",
  "I want to avenge\nShintani-sensei's death, too.": "",
  "I want to avenge Shintani-sensei's\ndeath, too.": "",
  "All right...\nThen we don't have time to lose!": "",
  "All right... We don't have\ntime to lose!": "",
  "We? Since when was it we?": "",
  "Huh? Now you're in?": "",
  "If this is really what Saori-san wants,\nI'll do everything in my power to help her!": "",
  "If Saori-san says she'll do it...\nI'll do everything in my power to support her!": "",
  "Well, okay.": "",
  "Oh, we'll need another makeover, right?\nI'll go this time! Mind if we use the same salon?": "",
  "Oh, we'll need makeup again, right? I can go this time!\nMind if we use the same salon?": "",
  "Sure, but I was thinking she'd be\na journalist this time, not a hostess.": "",
  "Sure, but I don't think she'll be playing a hostess.\nThis time, she'll have to act like a journalist.": "",
  "A journalist? Really?": "",
  "A journalist...?": "",
  "Think about it.\nYour mark is inside the ADDC, right?": "",
  "Your mark is inside the ADDC, right?": "",
  "You'll be able to get him alone much more\nnaturally if you go in asking for an interview.": "",
  "It's no cabaret. If you go in asking for an interview,\nyou'll be more likely to get him alone.": "",
  "Aha.": "",
  "Makes sense...": "",
  "And you'll need to dress the part. I'm talking high skirts\nand low cuts. That'll bring out the worst in any old lech.": "",
  "As for your clothes, they've gotta draw his eyes.\nI'm talking short skirts and low cuts.": "",
  "Now we're talking!\nI'll take that over a hostess any day.": "",
  "Whoa-ho! Forget hostesses;\nthat's classic charm!": "",
  "Okay! I have some things I need to take care of. Can you\nhead to the ADDC once you're done with your makeup, Saori-san?": "",
  "Anyway, I have some things I need to take care of.\nCan you head to the ADDC once your makeup's done?": "",
  "We'll meet there.": "",
  "Okay. I understand.": "",
  "Well, see you soon.": "",
  "We should be going too, Saori-san.\nLet's get you that makeover!": "",
  "Saori-san, we should get going too.\nTo the makeup artist!": "",
  "Here we are, Saori-san.\nHair Salon Cherry.": "",
  "Saori-san, this is the place.\nHair Salon Cherry.": "",
  "I'm... honestly a little nervous.": "",
  "I'm... a little nervous.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Why is <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he</font_kind> nervous?)</color>": "",
  "Didn't I already do this\nwhen I was a hostess?": "",
  "Can't we do what I did\nas a hostess?": "",
  "Sure, but everything's different\nthis time! Saori-san the journalist...": "",
  "Sure, I guess, but everything's different this time!\nSaori-san the journalist...": "",
  "An intellectual beauty... Classy...\nWorldly... What guy wouldn't fall for that?": "",
  "An intellectual beauty... with a mature charm\nto knock a guy's socks off...": "",
  "Don't give me that look.": "",
  "Don't look at me like that.": "",
  "Oh, sorry, I didn't mean to stare...": "",
  "Sorry, I didn't mean to stare...": "",
  "Anyway, I'm sure you'll be stunning\nno matter how much makeup you wear!": "",
  "Anyway, I'm sure you'll be stunning no matter what\nmakeup you wear! Guaranteed!": "",
  "And if I disappoint you?": "",
  "Well that's just not possible.": "",
  "That's impossible.": "",
  "I hope you're right.": "",
  "I knew it...\nYou're a goddess, Saori-san!": "",
  "I knew it... You look amazing,\nSaori-san!": "",
  "Just incredible. That off-limits allure...\nThat mature aura... ": "",
  "Just incredible. That intellectual allure...\nThe mature aura...": "",
  "Are you going to stop soon?": "",
  "Again with that?": "",
  "Sorry, I just...\ngot a little excited.": "",
  "Well, I'm ready to go.\nI can take it from here.": "",
  "So independent, too!\nEr... Sorry, I'll stop now.": "",
  "Saori-san, um...": "",
  "Don't push yourself, okay?": "",
  "If things get dangerous, just run.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'm glad you care,\nbut don't panic. I've got this.)</color>": "",
  "Yagami-san said I'll be safe, though.": "",
  "Well, yeah, your life might not be in danger... But what if\nKido tries to... you know, cop a feel or something?": "",
  "Well, yeah, your life might not be in danger, but...\nwhat if Kido tries to... you know, touch you?": "",
  "If that's what needs to happen,\nthat's what will happen.": "",
  "Then that's what happens.": "",
  "What!? But...": "",
  "By the way, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "Thank you for complimenting\nmy makeup. It felt... nice.": "",
  "...Thank you. For the compliment.\nIt felt good.": "",
  "Hold on, Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-san, hold on.": "",
  "Take this with you.\nIt's a hidden camera.": "",
  "Take this hidden camera with you.": "",
  "A what...?": "",
  "A camera...?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I suppose for this to work,\nwe'll need physical proof...)</color>": "",
  "See, this is the lens. Any footage it takes'll\nget sent to my phone in real time.": "",
  "See, this is the lens. Any footage it takes will\nget sent to my phone in real time.": "",
  "Here, wear this earpiece too.": "",
  "I'll give you some conversation\npointers while you're in there.": "",
  "I'll give you some conversation pointers\nwhile you're in there.": "",
  "Pointers?": "",
  "Yeah. This time you'll need to be seductive\nwith the words you say, not just your looks.": "",
  "This time the seduction won't just rely on your looks.\nYou'll have to say the right things and get him hooked.": "",
  "That's why...": "",
  "You're going to give me tips,\nYagami-san? I'd appreciate that.": "",
  "I can leave the flirting to you, then?\nI'd appreciate that.": "",
  "Wait, really?": "",
  "Wait, I have to?": "",
  "Of course. Knowing how to woo a man\nisn't exactly my specialty.": "",
  "Of course. Wooing a man\nisn't exactly my area of expertise.": "",
  "Also... what happens after I seduce him?": "",
  "What happens after I seduce him?": "",
  "Once Kido starts coming on to you...": "",
  "Once Kido starts coming on to you,\nwe'll catch it all on the hidden camera...": "",
  "We'll catch it all on the camera.": "",
  "Meaning there will be evidence\nof his sexual harassment.": "",
  "We'll have evidence of\nsexual harassment.": "",
  "Yeah. Your job'll be\ndone at that point.": "",
  "Yup. Your job'll be done\nat that point.": "",
  "All we'll need to do after that is use\nthe footage to lure him to Kamurocho.": "",
  "After that, we'll use what leverage we have\nto lure him back to Kamurocho.": "",
  "Blackmailing, hm?": "",
  "To avoid a sex scandal?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Secretly recording sexual harassment\nand blackmailing him with it? This is... a rush!)</color>": "",
  "Don't worry. The more perverted things\nKido does, the more he'll suffer later.": "",
  "Don't worry. The more perverted things he does,\nthe more he'll suffer later.": "",
  "True, I guess.": "",
  "I'd rather keep his hands off of me as much as possible,\nthough. That'll be on you and your direction, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'd rather keep his hands off of me if I can, though.\nThat'll be on you and your direction.": "",
  "Right. Anyway, you should head in.": "",
  "Right. Well, let's do this thing.": "",
  "Can you hear me, Saori-san? First you're\ngonna want to go to the reception desk.": "",
  "Okay, can you hear me, Saori-san?\nFirst, take a look around the lobby.": "",
  "Ask the lady there\nif you can interview Kido.": "",
  "Find the reception desk,\nand ask if you can interview Kido.": "",
  "Just make something up about wanting\nmore details on AD-9.": "",
  "Just make something up about\nwanting more details on AD-9.": "",
  "Welcome, ma'am.\nDo you have an appointment?": "",
  "Welcome. Do you have an appointment?": "",
  "No. I was wondering if Director Kido\nwould be available for an interview.": "",
  "No, I'm afraid not. I was hoping\nto interview Director Kido.": "",
  "A freelance journalist\nby the name of Shirosaki.": "",
  "A freelance journalist by the name\nof Shirosaki.": "",
  "I wanted to speak with him about AD-9.": "",
  "I wanted to speak with him\nabout AD-9.": "",
  "I'm terribly sorry, ma'am.\nI can't let you in without an appointment.": "",
  "Oh, I see. In that case, um...": "",
  "Don't be afraid to press\nthe issue, Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-san, you can press the issue.": "",
  "Director Kido is a very busy man.\nI'm sure you understand.": "",
  "I'm sure you understand.\nDirector Kido is a very busy man.": "",
  "It won't take long, I assure you.": "",
  "But... I assure you, it won't take long...": "",
  "And I can wait if need be.": "",
  "Even so...": "",
  "Please. Can I at least see\nKido-san and ask him myself?": "",
  "Please. Can I at least see Kido-san\nand ask him myself?": "",
  "I'm sorry, ma'am. We decline all\nrequests without a prior appointment.": "",
  "I'm afraid you need a prior appointment.\nI'm sorry, but those are the rules.": "",
  "Oh, I think I could make an exception\nfor such a pretty girl.": "",
  "Well... There are exceptions\nfor the fairer sex.": "",
  "I'm Kido, the director of this center.\nI hear you want to interview me?": "",
  "I'm Director Kido. I hear you\nwant to interview me?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, this is Kido.)</color>": "",
  "Ah, yes.\nMy name is Shirosaki.": "",
  "Oh, yes. My name is Shirosaki.": "",
  "Shirosaki-san, hm?": "",
  "Ah, Shirosaki-san...": "",
  "Come, I'll show you to my office. A beautiful woman\nlike yourself deserves VIP treatment.": "",
  "Well, aren't you a pretty one?\nHere, let me show you to my office.": "",
  "Are you sure, sir?\nThank you very much.": "",
  "You'd do that? Thank you so much!": "",
  "Ugh, Kido-san...": "",
  "Please, Director...": "",
  "So he's not even trying to hide it.\nNot that I'm complaining.": "",
  "Wow, this is your office?\nIt's breathtaking. I love how spacious it is.": "",
  "Wow, it's gorgeous... This is your office?\nIt's breathtaking.": "",
  "Oh, no need to flatter me. Though I do get\nquite a few compliments. Please, take a seat.": "",
  "No need to flatter me... though I get that a lot.\nPlease, take a seat.": "",
  "Saori-san.\nPut the camera on the table.": "",
  "Saori-san. Put the camera\non the table.": "",
  "You really must excuse me. I should have made an\nappointment instead of just showing up on your doorstep.": "",
  "You really must excuse me\nfor showing up unannounced...": "",
  "Move it a little to the right.\nAbout fifteen degrees.": "",
  "There, perfect.": "",
  "Would you care for a drink,\nShirosaki-san?": "",
  "Maybe a glass of brandy? There's one I found\nrecently that's truly top-shelf.": "",
  "Maybe a glass of brandy? There's one\nI found recently that's truly top-shelf.": "",
  "Well... sure, I'll have some.\nIt's a special occasion, after all.": "",
  "Sure, if you're offering.\nOne glass sounds fine.": "",
  "Here you are. I think I'm going\nto enjoy this interview.": "",
  "Excellent... I think I'm going to\nenjoy this interview.": "",
  "Good job, Saori-san.\nKeep it up.": "",
  "But it's the middle of the day.\nI can't have alcohol affecting my interview.": "",
  "Ah, well... I don't know.\nIn the middle of the day?": "",
  "Come now.\nYou don't need to be so stiff.": "",
  "Oh, no need to be so stiff.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but no.": "",
  "Um... I'm sorry, but...": "",
  "Take him up on it, Saori-san.\nWe need him to let his guard down.": "",
  "Saori-san, go ahead. We need him\nto let his guard down.": "",
  "Are you sure?\nJust one small glass.": "",
  "One glass couldn't hurt...?": "",
  "I dunno... Why do you want\nto get me drunk so bad?": "",
  "Well... I have to wonder, sir.\nWhy do you want to get me drunk so bad?": "",
  "Hmmm, I wonder.": "",
  "Hmmm... Why indeed?": "",
  "I'm just here for my job, y'know.": "",
  "Because, you know...\nI have a job to do here.": "",
  "Oh, yes. Of course.": "",
  "O-Of course! I know that...": "",
  "Who knows what would happen\nif I got drunk...": "",
  "If I got drunk, well...\nwho knows what would happen.": "",
  "Heh, I think I'm going\nto enjoy this interview.": "",
  "I think I'm going to enjoy\nthis interview...": "",
  "But I don't wannaaa.": "",
  "Uh... Saori-san?": "",
  "Uh... Hold on, Saori-san...": "",
  "That's cute. But...\nYou came to interview me, didn't you?": "",
  "That's certainly cute. But...\nyou came to interview me, didn't you?": "",
  "You understand what that means,\nyes? You're not a child.": "",
  "You understand what that means, yes?\nYou're not a child.": "",
  "Ah... Yes.": "",
  "Well then, let's have a glass.": "",
  "Good job, Saori-san.\nKido's a real piece of shit...": "",
  "Good job.\nKido's a real piece of shit...": "",
  "Keep it up.": "",
  "Okay, keep it up.": "",
  "To a wonderful interview.": "",
  "To a fruitful interview.": "",
  "Yes, to the interview.": "",
  "Mm, it's incredible.": "",
  "Really warms you up,\ndeep in your core, right?": "",
  "Good brandy warms you up\ndown to your core, right?": "",
  "Undo another button, Saori-san.": "",
  "Saori-san. Time to undo a button\non your blouse.": "",
  "Already!?": "",
  "Mm? What's wrong?": "",
  "Oh, um... No. It's just...\ngetting a little toasty in here.": "",
  "Well, er, yes...\nI am feeling warmer.": "",
  "Good going.\nHe's taking the bait.": "",
  "Good going. He's taking the bait.": "",
  "Now then, er...\nWhat is this interview about?": "",
  "Now then, er...\nwhat is this interview regarding?": "",
  "I want to know...\nevery little detail about you.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Aha.": "อ้อ",
  "Makes sense...": "ก็มีเหตุผลนะ...",
  "I hope you're right.": "หวังว่านายจะพูดถูกนะ",
  "A what...?": "อะไรนะ...?",
  "That's why...": "เพราะงั้น...",
  "Wait, really?": "เดี๋ยว จริงดิ?",
  "Even so...": "ถึงอย่างนั้นก็เถอะ...",
  "You'd do that? Thank you so much!": "ไปด้วยจริงๆ เหรอคะ? ขอบคุณมากเลยค่ะ!"
 }
}
